image/upload/t_thumb/ao2ot9waqmmafkhgdbwf.jpg"}, {"id": 14638, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/wva3gbcgdsv2r9hf8w2d.jpg"}, {"id": 320321, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6v5t.jpg"}, {"id": 320323, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6v5v.jpg"}, {"id": 320320, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6v5s.jpg"}, {"id": 551302, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scbtdy.jpg"}, {"id": 551303, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scbtdz.jpg"}, {"id": 551305, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scbte1.jpg"}, {"id": 551306, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scbte2.jpg"}, {"id": 551307, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scbte3.jpg"}, {"id": 551338, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scbtey.jpg"}, {"id": 320322, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6v5u.jpg"}], "slug": "the-sims-4-get-together", "storyline": "You set the rules, select the members, and customize the exclusive hangouts in The Sims 4: Get Together. Sims in a Club will follow your rules when they\u2019re together, giving you new ways to play with your Sims.\n\nWhether you\u2019re getting stylish with the Paragons or enjoying a delicious meal with the Upper Crusts, there are a variety of interesting Clubs to explore. As you play with Clubs, you\u2019ll unlock perks including secret handshakes, social boosts and more!\n\nLet the games begin! Take on other Sims in foosball, darts, and Don't Wake The Llama. Get cozy with your crush or do a special fire dance around the bonfire. Plus show off your best cannonballs and make a splash with the new jumping platform.\n\nTake the party to the next level with new DJ & Dancing skills. Pump up the crowd with the perfect mix in the DJ Booth. Then jump onto the dance floor and challenge other Sims to an epic dance battle!\n\nDiscover the beautiful new world of Windenburg, with its scenic neighborhoods and picturesque landmarks, including the sprawling hedge maze at the Von Haunt Estate, the alluring pools along the bluffs, and the mysterious ancient ruins.", "summary": "Create Clubs for your Sims where you set the rules, define their looks, and customize their hangouts in The Sims 4: Get Together. Sims in a club follow your rules when they're together, regardless of how they usually behave, giving you new ways to play with your Sims! You can also meet new Sims by joining various Clubs with distinct interests, identities, and styles. Get together with other Sims for exciting group activities like super-secret dance parties, midnight bonfires, and more. Explore the beautiful new world of Windenburg, with its scenic neighborhoods and lively hotspots!", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-sims-4-get-together", "videos": [{"id": 52683, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "HBHtKDQqOuM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HBHtKDQqOuM", "title": "The Sims 4 Get Together: Explore A New World Official Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HBHtKDQqOuM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 52684, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "50KNNqCR8gI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=50KNNqCR8gI", "title": "The Sims 4 Get Together: Come to Windenburg!", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/50KNNqCR8gI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 52681, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "X4owA7k9UrY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X4owA7k9UrY", "title": "The Sims 4 Get Together: Official Announce Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X4owA7k9UrY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 52682, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "p98DDYOiVOY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p98DDYOiVOY", "title": "The Sims 4 Get Together: Rule The Dance Floor Official Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/p98DDYOiVOY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 52685, "n